  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Light passes from a medium into air. The critical angle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta_{c}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Which expression gives the speed of light in the medium?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{c sin \\theta_{c}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin \\theta_{c}}{c}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{c}{sin \\theta_{c}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c sin \\theta_{c}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
